      "title": "HR",
      "description": "Home Skip to main content Human Resources Search Search: Menu Search Close Search: Working Here Working Here Career Opportunities Student Employment Culture and History Who's Who Campus Life Attractions and Resources Benefits Benefits Open Enrollment Health and Welfare Benefits Tuition Benefits Time-Off Benefits Employee Assistance Program FMLA & Leave of Absence Retirement Savings Plans Retiree Benefits A Healthier U Wellness Program Life and Disability Insurance Other Benefits Resources & FAQs Your Career Your Career Career Pathway New Dragons SOAR Onboarding Talent Development Compensation and Salaries Electronic Faculty Annual Reviews (FARs) Performance Development Process Enterprise Learning Employee Resources Employee Resources HR Service Center Employee Forms Policies Inclusive Culture & Belonging Program Management & Organizational Effectiveness Flexible Work Arrangements Software for Employees Protection of Minors Communications Playbook Employment Verifications Manager Tools Manager Tools Staff Your Organization Budget Administration Resources Management Forms Resources About About Departments Events Calendar Special Events Announcements Volunteers Contact Directory HR at Your Service Megan Weyler Senior Vice President and Chief Human Resources Officer, Human Resources and Organizational Effectiveness 215.895.2850 hr@drexel.edu Department of Human Resources The Department of Human Resources is dedicated to supporting Drexel University's most valuable resource – its people. Strategic progress depends on employees who are engaged, prepared and rewarded. Career Opportunities HR Service Center Career Pathway Drexel Takes Second-Place in Healthiest Employers of Pennsylvania Award Get the Most Out of Career Pathway New Vision, Hearing and SLP Benefits HR Spotlight Your Benefits Learn about your benefits for medical, retirement, tuition remission, time off and more. Talent Development Review all programming that supports your professional development. A Healthier U A one-stop shop for resources that foster your mental, physical and financial well-being. HR Policies Browse HR's Official University Policies. Colleague Resource Groups A Colleague Resource Group (CRG) consists of 10 or more faculty and professional staff members who work together to promote Drexel's mission and foster a sense of community. Learn More About CRGs at Drexel Announcements HR @ Your Service: August 2026 Edition Aug 19, 2026 In this issue, explore upcoming professional development opportunities from HR, Goodwin and the Office of the Comptroller... and much more. HR @ Your Service: July 2026 Edition Jul 22, 2026 July 2026 edition of the HR newsletter HR @ Your Service: June 2026 Edition Jun 17, 2026 Set up your summer to-do list with the June 2026 edition of the HR @ Your Service newsletter. View All News and Announcements Upcoming Events September 9, 2026 9:00 — 9:30 AM Yoga for Anxiety (15 Wellness Points)* Zoom; registration in Career Pathway is required; the link to join will be sent by Career Pathway after you register September 24, 2026 10:00 — 11:30 AM Developmental Leadership Webcast - see reminder email for link September 29, 2026 12:00 — 1:00 PM Fraud Defense Essentials: What You Need to Know (15 Wellness Points)* Zoom; please register in Career Pathway to receive the Zoom link September 30, 2026 10:00 — 10:30 AM Chair Yoga: Stretches for Office Workers (15 Wellness Points)* Please register in Career Pathway for this live Zoom event. The Zoom link will be sent with the confirmation email in Career Pathway. View All Events Contact Us HR Service Center Suite 430 3201 Arch St Philadelphia, PA 19104 215.895.2850 hr@drexel.edu Contact your HR Business Partner In-Person Hours Monday-Thursday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Remote Hours Monday-Friday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Top Drexel University 3141 Chestnut Street Philadelphia, PA 19104 View on Map 215.895.2000 Emergency Contact Press Careers Follow Drexel Copyright © 2026 Drexel University. All rights reserved. Privacy & Legal Copyright © 2026 Drexel University. All rights reserved. Privacy & Legal"
